WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Misty Steps starts with a map of where you live, hidden in mist.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Tap Start wandering and go for a walk.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:17.000
The mist lifts wherever you walk. Your path stays on your phone.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Drop a pin where you want to remember a place: a bench, a view, a cat.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.500
Watch your map clear up. No accounts, no scores, no friends list.
